    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n16334" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">eugĕnēus</span></b>  or <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-īus</span></b> , a, um,
