					R. 6, 4</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Varr. R. R. 1, 25</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">(uvae),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 2, 16</span></i>
			.</div>
